WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.655
We will move from concepts to implementation

00:00:02.682 --> 00:00:07.307
gradually First we build the relational mental

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:11.309
model You will identify entities attributes row

00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:16.141
grain keys and relationships Then we focus

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.946
on protection Constraints and normalization help
keep

00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:22.209
the data consistent even when many users

00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:26.737
or applications interact with the database After

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.592
that we connect the design to PostgreSQL

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.766
You will run completed examples before you

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.397
are asked to change or write small

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:39.169
pieces yourself The coding progression is
intentional

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:43.887
run change complete and then write You

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.848
are not expected to memorize a long

00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:49.258
CREATE TABLE script Instead learn how to

00:00:49.271 --> 00:00:51.140
read the pieces and explain why each

00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:51.995
one exists
